    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off to Deliver noodles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road ahead is swarming with crazed space bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your steel delivery backpack, arm yourself, and fight your way through to complete the delivery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run &amp; Gun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.poster.avif?t=1748539630\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.webm?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.mp4?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through endless swarms of alien bugs and push forward to your destination.<br>Dodge relentless attacks from all sides, find enemy weak points, and strike back with precision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backpack Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.poster.avif?t=1748539630\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.webm?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.mp4?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the true power of your seemingly ordinary <strong>steel delivery backpack</strong>!<br>With each stage cleared, expand your backpack, optimize deadly weapons and items, and create powerful synergies.<br>Build your ultimate <strong>weapon system</strong> to exploit enemy weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to your destination, the stronger and more unpredictable the space bugs become.<br>Adapt your combat style to counter their relentless mutations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge... and Fire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you survive and complete your delivery mission!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off to Deliver noodles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road ahead is swarming with crazed space bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your steel delivery backpack, arm yourself, and fight your way through to complete the delivery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run &amp; Gun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.poster.avif?t=1748539630\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.webm?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/2a2c949ec9b76b87a37bb5787805b1de.mp4?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through endless swarms of alien bugs and push forward to your destination.<br>Dodge relentless attacks from all sides, find enemy weak points, and strike back with precision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backpack Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.poster.avif?t=1748539630\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.webm?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/19b8db255da1700d09d0c59f635f6dbb.mp4?t=1748539630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the true power of your seemingly ordinary <strong>steel delivery backpack</strong>!<br>With each stage cleared, expand your backpack, optimize deadly weapons and items, and create powerful synergies.<br>Build your ultimate <strong>weapon system</strong> to exploit enemy weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to your destination, the stronger and more unpredictable the space bugs become.<br>Adapt your combat style to counter their relentless mutations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge... and Fire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you survive and complete your delivery mission!</p>",
